<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Healthcare started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Healthcare started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had started coverage of Healthcare COMPARE Corp with a rating of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 42-7/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
